  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development hereby permitted shall begin before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.\r\rReason: This is required by Section 91 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).",
    "The development to which this permission relates shall be carried out in accordance with the materials specified on the approved plans and on the submitted application form unless otherwise agreed in writing by the local planning authority.\r\rReason: To ensure a satisfactory appearance on completion of the development, in accordance with Policy D3 of the London Plan 2021 and Policies CS8 and DM10 of the LDF Core Strategy 2012.",
    "The development must be carried out in accordance with the provisions of the Fire Safety Statement unless otherwise approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority. \r\rReason: To ensure that the development incorporates the necessary fire safety measures in accordance with the Mayor's London Plan Policy D12.",
    "The plant equipment hereby permitted shall only operate between the daytime hours of 07:00 and 23:00 each day, as outlined in the Noise Impact Assessment prepared by AF Acoustics, dated 27 April 2026.\r\rReason: To safeguard the amenity of the neighbours by minimising impacts of the plant equipment during night hours."
